-The method was discussed in the context of implementing volume rendering using GLSL and OpenTK, specifically addressing the issue of the view disappearing when the camera moves inside the volume's bounding box. It was presented as a solution to "flow through the volume" by dynamically shifting the ray entry point. [S1, unofficial]
